        <detaileddescription>
<para>Outputs the solution matrix to a textfile in <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_sparse_matrix" kindref="compound">SparseMatrix</ref> output format.</para>
<sect1 id="group___c_s_m_pglobal_functions_1arguments">
<title>Input Arguments</title><para>The first argument is a constant reference to the solution matrix and the second argument is the name of the file which the matrix will be output to. To this file name, the global runtime of the model and the extension &apos;.text&apos; will be appended. <linebreak/>
</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="namespacecsmp_1implementation">
<title>Implementation</title><para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_solver_1afb9380e536b4d7080c89cf143421c6f2" kindref="member">Out()</ref> calls the Meschach function sp_foutput().</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="group___c_s_m_pglobal_enums_1application">
<title>Application Examples</title><para>To independently test the solution matrix or to transfer it to another solver.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="group___c_s_m_pglobal_functions_1messages">
<title>Messages</title><para>A successful write will be reported. </para>
</sect1>
